    "label": "54",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following algebraic fractions.\n$$\\frac{1-\\dfrac{1-x}{1+x}}{1+\\dfrac{1-x}{1+x}}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x$, $x\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-1\\}$.",
      "worked": "Multiply top and bottom by $1+x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1-\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}{1+\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}&=\\frac{(1+x)-(1-x)}{(1+x)+(1-x)}\\\\\\frac{1-\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}{1+\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}&=\\frac{2x}{2}\\\\\\frac{1-\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}{1+\\frac{1-x}{1+x}}&=x\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $x\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-1\\}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
